      "start": 60.511,
      "end": 71.117,
      "duration": 10.606,
      "confidence": "aligned",
      "text": "So Brewster, I thought we might start if we could go way back in time to your time at MIT and, you know, where the origin of your idea of creating a new \"Library of Alexandria\" came from?",
      "reuse_status": "REUSED",
      "reason": "text and timestamp both unchanged -- clip_001.mp4 is still valid",
